      "priority": 2,
      "category": "semantic-registration",
      "file": "RobWork/doc/industrial-robot-design/reuse/functions/project.json",
      "line": 2388,
      "functionId": "project.Codec.anonymous.requirePathField",
      "title": "路径接受面被误记为ASCII",
      "observed": "differences写4096字节ASCII路径字段profile。Codec.cpp 773-778明确允许空格/非ASCII/中文路径；779-794只要求非空、<=4096 UTF8字节，并拒绝字节<0x20或==0x7F。parseString/parseUnicodeEscape在进入requirePathField前已把JSON Unicode转义还原为UTF8，不能把磁盘JSON的ASCII字节形态当作路径值的ASCII限制。",
      "impact": "该关系是后续typed parser/schema适配的语义依据，错误profile可能导致迁移后拒绝现有合法中文路径，改变已有接受/拒绝契约。",
      "evidence": [
        "RobWork/RobWorkStudio/src/rwslibs/industrialrobot/project/src/Codec.cpp:773-794",
        "RobWork/RobWorkStudio/src/rwslibs/industrialrobot/project/src/Codec.cpp:299-399",
        "RobWork/RobWorkStudio/src/rwslibs/industrialrobot/project/src/Codec.cpp:1416-1418",
        "semantic-evidence.log"
      ],
      "requestedChange": "只纠正该关系的语义描述：解码后的UTF8路径值允许空格/非ASCII，非空、<=4096字节、拒C0/DEL；磁盘JSON仍为ASCII转义载体。保留io路径解析/存在性/安全权威边界，不改产品接受面。",
      "reproducedProductDefect": false,
      "status": "OPEN"
    }
  ],
